---
title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Session
    lg1: Breaks CustodyKept or NoInputLoss
    lg2: Path to the CustodyKept or NoInputLoss bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 breaks
  class lg2 bugPath
  s0: No session
  s1: No session, a message waiting
  s2: No session, input lost
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: no host: one notice, the message is kept
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
